  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Your truck is the wrecking ball. Pump with movement controls; ACTION gives
    a short reel tug on cooldown. Physical impacts damage the original tower and
    ten additional reachable buildings, bringing unsupported floors down. Return
    hits can finish a partially damaged structure; settled rubble remains physical
    and wakes on contact. Each structural module scores only once; loose rubble cannot
    farm points. Three simultaneous 60-second rounds, most destruction points wins.
    Tied leaders play a 20-second extra round. The siren locks scores BEFORE the
    automatic demolition finale. Finale destruction awards no points. A genuine stuck
    truck is rehung with three seconds of lost control. Escape pauses all bays; reconnect
    preserves current state.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
